99
00:08:54,770 --> 00:08:56,893
Oke. Sebentar lagi selesai.

100
00:09:00,230 --> 00:09:03,269
Hei, ada apa? Kamu baik saja?

101
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:06,729
Ya. Kurasa begitu.

102
00:09:06,730 --> 00:09:10,750
Ayo. kita cari udara segar.

103
