121
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:28,110
Apa?

122
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:30,940
Aku minta maaf.

123
00:10:35,950 --> 00:10:37,169
Aku...

124
00:10:38,170 --> 00:10:40,229
Aku pria paling
beruntung di dunia.

125
00:10:40,230 --> 00:10:41,309
Apa?

126
00:10:41,310 --> 00:10:44,569
- Kamu tidak marah?
- Marah? Tidak, ini...

127
00:10:44,570 --> 00:10:46,849
- Ini luar biasa!
- Sungguh?

128
00:10:46,850 --> 00:10:49,110
Kita sedang memulai
sebuah keluarga.

129
00:10:51,930 --> 00:10:53,129
Jadi...

130
00:10:53,730 --> 00:10:55,549
Maukah kamu menikah denganku?

131
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:56,950
Ya!

132
00:11:06,470 --> 00:11:08,709
