137
00:13:54,434 --> 00:13:55,908
Bertahanlah! / Lepaskan!

138
00:13:56,008 --> 00:13:59,755
Mundur. Mundur! / 
Tunggu!

139
00:14:01,543 --> 00:14:03,988
Paul! Raih tanganku.

140
00:14:04,115 --> 00:14:05,497
Tidak!

141
00:14:05,910 --> 00:14:07,416
Tidak!

142
