145
00:15:15,370 --> 00:15:17,370
Ke lift.

146
00:15:22,770 --> 00:15:25,570
Permisi, Pak, aku
harus menekan tombol.

147
00:15:29,210 --> 00:15:30,669
Tidak!

148
00:15:31,070 --> 00:15:35,793
Biarkan aku masuk! / Mundur! 
Kami tidak punya tempat lagi di sini.

149
00:15:35,794 --> 00:15:37,817
Kubilang minggir.

150
00:15:37,818 --> 00:15:39,818
Biarkan aku masuk!

151
00:16:37,268 --> 00:16:39,034
Oh, plis!

152
00:16:40,994 --> 00:16:43,294
Raih tanganku. Ayo.

153
00:18:04,570 --> 00:18:05,956
Tolong!

154
00:18:06,594 --> 00:18:07,839
Tolong!

155
00:19:01,460 --> 00:19:02,519
Wow!

156
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:06,476
Memang benar kalau matematika
secara umum menakutkan, tetapi

157
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:07,839
